{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41188","headline":"送刘散员同赋陈思王诗得好鸟鸣高枝 · 刘斌","name":"送刘散员同赋陈思王诗得好鸟鸣高枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春林已自好，时鸟复和鸣。\n枝交难奋翼，谷静易流声。\n间关才得性，[矰]缴遽相惊。\n安知背飞远，拂雾独晨征。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}